<TITLE>Steering Gear</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A lightweight, compact rack &amp; pinion type steering gear with excellent operability has been adopted.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The housing is a one-piece aluminum part to reduce weight.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The steering gear is mounted to the front suspension member via bushings.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A low-friction type rack guide is adopted and the coil spring has been optimized, reducing frictional resistance.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
